  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local and Regional Food Aid Procurement Pilot Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Local and Regional Food Aid Procurement Project (USDA LRP Project) was authorized as a pilot program under the Food, Conservation, and Energy Act of 2008 (Farm Bill). The primary purpose of the USDA LRP Project is to examine the timeliness and efficiency of local and regional procurement (LRP) as a tool to enhance USG food assistance programs.</narrative>
  </description>
